{"speciesId":895,"names":{"fr":"Regidrago","es":"Regidrago","en":"Regidrago","ja":"レジドラゴ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Une théorie stipule que ses bras ont la forme de la tête d’un Pokémon Dragon des temps anciens, mais aucune preuve ne l’atteste."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cierta teoría afirma que la forma de sus brazos representa la cabeza de un Pokémon dragón ancestral, aunque esto no ha podido verificarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"An academic theory proposes that Regidrago’s arms were once the head of an ancient dragon Pokémon. The theory remains unproven."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"腕の 形は 古代の ドラゴン ポケモンの 頭という 学説も あるが 証明されていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son corps est entièrement composé de cristaux d’énergie draconique. Il possèderait les pouvoirs de tous les Pokémon Dragon."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Todo su cuerpo es una gema de energía dragón cristalizada. Se cree que posee los poderes de todos los Pokémon dragón."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its body is composed of crystallized dragon energy. Regidrago is said to have the powers of every dragon Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"全身が ドラゴンエネルギーの 結晶。 すべての ドラゴン ポケモンの 力を 持つらしい。"}],"varieties":[{"id":895,"moves":[{"name":"vice-grip","learns":[[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[20,"level-up",54],[25,"level-up",54]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[20,"level-up",6],[25,"level-up",6]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[20,"level-up",72],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",72],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"light-screen","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"reflect","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"focus-energy","learns":[[20,"level-up",24],[20,"machine",0],[25